  "notes": [
    "phase is the wait for the next observer tick, reported separately and excluded from ipc_added: it exists in embedded too (issue #920, lie 6)",
    "ipc_added = hop_in + extract + encode + hop_out + decode_out = t_decode - t0",
    "the #920 stand/overturn bands are defined at N = 24 on WINDOWS; a report from any other platform is informational only",
    "warmup ticks are excluded from every sample (allocator and branch warmth, issue #920 lie 9)",
    "I/O is blocking std on dedicated threads; no async runtime is measured (issue #920 lie 8)",
    "the sidecar is event-driven, so no scheduling wait is hidden inside its columns; the extraction contract is shape-faithful, not a Bevy App"
